  "details": "VRC+ is way too expensive and Im sad and worried now that full on features are being paywalled. But I would subscribe if it was much cheaper.\n\nA much cheaper alternative where you get either all features but limited, like 2 stickers or one extra favorite slot etc. Or where you can chooose only a number of features to unlock, maybe in two or three tiers with smaller visual features to big ones like camera dolly (which should be for everyone already).\n\nI think way more people would sign up than people who would downgrade. And getting more people to try something smaller would also make people more inclined to pay for the full thing. More options should always be strived for and to minimize the divide of people based on money.",
